  "problem": "Agents could not compare source suitability or export a reproducible metadata packet. compare_assets could return a generic complete result with empty facts. Individually valid joins could be promoted to a combined path without compatibility checks. Packet exports could contain credentials or hidden research-query telemetry. HTTP 200 or a successful tool envelope could be treated as a completed research task.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Comparing HCRIS and PHC4 shows differing reporting definitions rather than a generic complete result with empty facts. An individually valid pair of joins cannot be promoted to a valid combined path without compatibility checks. The export can be validated offline and reproduces source identities without invoking LLMs or fetching source data. Comparison completeness is about populated relevant dimensions, not envelope construction. Exports contain no credentials or hidden research-query telemetry. A successful tool envelope is not a completed research task. HTTP 200 is not acceptance. worker/index.mjs does not import enrichment. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
